#, no-wrap
msgid "Sherrington-Kirkpatrick model {#sherrington-kirkpatrick-model}"
msgstr "Modelo ng Sherrington-Kirkpatrick {#sherrington-kirkpatrick-model}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Figure 2 demonstrates the effectiveness of the Parity Twine Optimizer. This compares results obtained using the optimizer against random sampling for the Sherrington-Kirkpatrick model\n"
"with increasing qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ipinapakita ng Figure 2 ang pagiging epektibo ng Parity Twine Optimizer. Inihahambing nito ang mga resultang nakuha gamit ang optimizer laban sa random sampling para sa Sherrington-Kirkpatrick model\n"
"sa pagdami ng mga qubit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Post-processing of both the random and optimizer results leads to exact ground states, but the raw minimum energy output from Twine QAOA is always better than random\n"
"values. For the largest qubit numbers considered (90 and 100), hardware noise degrades the optimizer result where it reverts to raw values matching random sampling.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang post-processing ng parehong random at optimizer results ay humahantong sa eksaktong ground states, ngunit ang raw minimum energy output mula sa Twine QAOA ay palaging mas mahusay kaysa sa random\n"
"na values. Para sa pinakamalaking bilang ng qubit na isinaalang-alang (90 at 100), binababa ng hardware noise ang resulta ng optimizer kung saan ito bumabalik sa raw values na katumbas ng random sampling.\n"

