msgstr "Market Split Problem {#market-split-problem}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Table 1 shows specific performance metrics for the Parity Twine Optimizer applied to various instances of the Market Split (MS) problem.\n"
"These were obtained from the [QOBLIB - Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB) and correspond to\n"
"[submissions](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB/tree/main/01-marketsplit/submissions/20260728_Parity_Twine_Optimizer) made to the\n"
"library using the Parity Twine Optimizer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ipinapakita ng Table 1 ang mga tiyak na performance metric para sa Parity Twine Optimizer na inilapat sa iba't ibang instance ng Market Split (MS) problem.\n"
"Kinuha ang mga ito mula sa [QOBLIB - Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB) at tumutugma sa mga\n"
"[submission](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB/tree/main/01-marketsplit/submissions/20260728_Parity_Twine_Optimizer) na isinumite sa\n"
"library gamit ang Parity Twine Optimizer.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"MS violation is an accuracy metric that measures how far the solution is from satisfying all constraints, defined as $\\sum_i ((Ax - b)_i)^2$. Lower values of this metric indicate more accurate solutions.\n"
"Table 1 reports averaged values for five runs of each instance using the Parity Twine Optimizer with the `ibm_boston` device as a backend and 100,000 shots.\n"
"The minimum MS violation obtained from the runs of each instance is reported.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang MS violation ay isang accuracy metric na sumusukat kung gaano kalayo ang solusyon sa pagtupad sa lahat ng constraint, na tinutukoy bilang $\\sum_i ((Ax - b)_i)^2$. Ang mas mababang values ng metric na ito ay nagpapahiwatig ng mas tumpak na solusyon.\n"
"Inilathala ng Table 1 ang averaged values para sa limang run ng bawat instance gamit ang Parity Twine Optimizer na may `ibm_boston` device bilang backend at 100,000 shots.\n"
"Inilathala ang minimum MS violation na nakuha mula sa mga run ng bawat instance.\n"

