# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maximum Independent Set problem {#maximum-independent-set-problem}"
msgstr "Maximum Independent Set Problem {#maximum-independent-set-problem}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Figure 3 compares results obtained using the Parity Twine optimizer against random sampling for the maximum independent set problem for selected instances\n"
"obtained from the [QOBLIB - Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB). These range from 18 (mammalia-kangaroo-interactions) to\n"
"114 (es60fst03) qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inihahambing ng Figure 3 ang mga resultang nakuha gamit ang Parity Twine optimizer laban sa random sampling para sa maximum independent set problem para sa mga piniling instance\n"
"na kinuha mula sa [QOBLIB - Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB). Ang mga ito ay saklaw mula 18 (mammalia-kangaroo-interactions) hanggang\n"
"114 (es60fst03) qubit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For small instances, the raw Maximum Independent Set size results from the optimizer and random sampling are similar, but for larger instances, the optimizer gives far better results.\n"
"Post-processing of both the random-sampled and optimizer results again leads to set sizes in agreement with exact values.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa maliliit na instance, magkatulad ang raw Maximum Independent Set size results mula sa optimizer at random sampling, ngunit para sa mas malalaking instance, mas malaki ang naibibigay na resulta ng optimizer.\n"
"Ang post-processing ng parehong random-sampled at optimizer results ay muling humahantong sa mga set size na tugma sa eksaktong values.\n"

