#, no-wrap
msgid "Refer to the [API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/parity-twine-optimizer) for full details of the input to and output from the Parity Twine Optimizer function.\n"
msgstr "Tingnan ang [sanggunian sa API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/parity-twine-optimizer) para sa kumpletong detalye ng input at output ng Parity Twine Optimizer function.\n"

